description	"10th Brother (Prosset Dibs)

A hyper-mobile dual-shoto Inquisitor scout and tracker.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Tracks On Hit
-- 30% Faster Swings
-- Cripples/Force Focuses On Hit
- Dual Inquisitor Shoto Sabers (Dual Style)
-- Tracks On Hit
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Deflect (2)

^5Force Powers:
- Grip (2)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (3)
- Jump (3)

^8Attributes:
- Portable Radar
- Stat Viewer
- Sense Immunity
- Dexterity (3)
- Force Block (2)
- Miraluka (Perma Sense)
- Force Focus (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- Tracking Beacon
- Aerial Force Regen
- Health Regen Capped At 35
- Slow Faller
- Melee Resist
- Anti MT (2)

^3Abilities:
- Dexterity Roll ^3[CS3]
- Tracking Darts (12) ^3[CS4]
- Enemy Scanner ^3[CS2]"